// An icon is one emoji, put before a part's label so the eye finds the
// part at once: a sun by Evaporation, a cloud by Condensation. A photo is
// a real picture of a part, shown under the drawing and tied to its part.
// Kosika keeps them only where they help: an icon has no letters or
